    Vi: "Bi\u1EC7t danh ch\u1EC9 c\xF3 th\u1EC3 \u0111\u1EB7t b\u1EB1ng ch\u1EEF
      c\xE1i ti\u1EBFng Anh.\\n- C\xF3 th\u1EC3 t\u1EA1o trong kho\u1EA3ng 4~8 k\xFD
